{"id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-subobjects.md","title":"Definition — Subobjects","display":"Definition — Subobjects","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-subobjects","aliases":["14-df-subobjects"],"display":"Definition — Subobjects","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-morphism]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-subobjects"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-subobjects</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Subobjects"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>。Hom、单态射、同构分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_B\">\\(M_B\\)</span> 是下式给出的单态射集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_B\">\\(\\sim_B\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_B\\times M_B\">\\(M_B\\times M_B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]_{\\sim_B}\">\\([m]_{\\sim_B}\\)</span> 是其等价类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_B\\coloneqq\\{m\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(m)=B\\land\\mathrm{IsMono}_{\\mathcal C}(m)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_B\\coloneqq\\{m\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(m)=B\\land\\mathrm{IsMono}_{\\mathcal C}(m)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\sim_B n\\leftrightarrow\\exists i\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(m),\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(n))\\ (\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C}(i)\\land n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}i=m)\\qquad(m,n\\in M_B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\sim_B n\\leftrightarrow\\exists i\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(m),\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(n))\\ (\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C}(i)\\land n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}i=m)\\qquad(m,n\\in M_B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(B)\\coloneqq M_B/{\\sim_B}=\\{[m]_{\\sim_B}\\mid m\\in M_B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(B)\\coloneqq M_B/{\\sim_B}=\\{[m]_{\\sim_B}\\mid m\\in M_B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.3 Characteristic Functions of Subobjects。</p>\n<p>单射到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的同构类是子对象。这里只对单态射取商；集合性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 保证。子对象的顺序、代表无关性和逆像见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文",