{\\mathcal C}i=m)\\qquad(m,n\\in M_B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(B)\\coloneqq M_B/{\\sim_B}=\\{[m]_{\\sim_B}\\mid m\\in M_B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\in\\mathcal V","display":false}],"bytes":1476,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects|Definition — Subobjects]]"},{"id":"78d84752064c9948","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]"},{"id":"0a94cb99ec341b7c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$ (subobject, see [[14-df-subobjects]])"},{"id":"1131fa8ff0b18434","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为固定初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 为 Lawvere–Tierney 拓扑，$X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。$\\chi_A:X\\to\\Omega$ 是子对象 $A$ 的唯一特征箭头；它由 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]] 与 [[14-df-subobjects]] 的代表等价确定。子对象序及运算见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]、[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。$\\mathrm{Cl}_j$ 在本条绑定的 $X$ 上解释。"},{"id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fc5aaf8518e020c2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$ 为 $S$ 上的几何理论，模型对象条件见 [[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]。构造模型范畴时，$M,N,P$ 遍历其模型对象集合；模型态射编码为 $(M,N,h)$，$h,k$ 为底层分量族，$\\operatorname{IsModelHom}$ 对任意同签名结构解释。子对象类采用 [[14-df-subobjects]]；子对象逆像和次序采用 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]。"},{"id":"db72d6d752e21e20","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6ccc7c06d940d91","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]"},{"id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"特征函数各式另假设 $\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Omega,t)$；$1=\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(t)$，$m:S\\hookrightarrow X$，$A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal C}(X)$。子对象商集见 [[14-df-subobjects]]。固定 $(\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t)$ 后，$\\chi_m$ 缩写 $\\mathrm{Char}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t}(m)$，$\\chi_A$ 缩写 $\\mathrm{CharSub}_{\\mathcal C,\\Omega,t,X}(A)$；$\\top$ 可作 $t$ 的别名。"},{"id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b6a2f7cb930ac02","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c1caa9c6c6dfe850","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects|Definition — Subobjects]]"},{"id":"8e769e1f3e412be1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84ceb81f5fd17693","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0e7878d33550867c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a62d3691c564e069","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0f04b1f6787215b0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"子对象序和顶采用 [[14-df-subobjects]]、[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]，二元交 $\\wedge_1$ 采用 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。$\\Theta_X$ 是下式定义的映射；对任意 $S\\subseteq|L|$ 的上确界保持以下式的最小上界性质表达。"},{"id":"2529efea1cd2e435","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}$、$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{IsNatural}$、$\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}$、$\\mathrm{IsLeftExact}$ 依次使用[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-functor]]、[[14-df-natural-transformation]]、[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[14-df-flat-set-functor]]的已列定义；其结构参数由上述 $\\mathcal E,\\mathcal H,i,a_j,\\eta$ 固定。$\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal H}(a_j(A))$ 采用 [[14-df-subobjects]] 的单态射同构类集合。"},{"id":"2f47f9749d4510aa","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"abee8603b9a8b54a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f097cd189a36cae9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯；$f:A\\to B$ 为箭头。$\\mathrm{IsRegular},\\mathrm{IsRegularEpi}$ 见 [[14-df-regular-epimorphism-regular-category]]。单态射同构类见 [[14-df-subobjects]]。"}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc","5c5452002ba29fda","d5f547b903550705","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","b51ff4f43221971d"]}